{
    "title": "Unscramble That - Word Puzzle",
    "description": "Unscramble That, the free word game that keeps you thinking and relaxing. Merging anagram challenges with nonogram puzzles, this game offers a fresh twist on classic puzzle gameplay by focusing on finding patterns and using logic.\r\n\r\nIn Unscramble That, your objective is to uncover hidden phrases by unscrambling words. Each level presents a series of clues that guide you to guess words and find the solution to the secret message. As you organize the letters and find the words, the hidden phrase gradually appears, leaving you with a sense of satisfaction.\r\n\r\nThe educational aspect of Unscramble That sets it apart from other word games. With each level, players uncover interesting historical facts, idioms, and quotes from literary figures. This enriching content not only broadens your lexicon but also deepens your appreciation for language.\r\n\r\n- Find Pattern: Think outside the box as you identify hidden sequences and connections.\r\n- Unscramble: Use your vocabulary to decode and reveal hidden phrases.\r\n- Read Quotes: Discover wisdom through famous quotes and literary insights.\r\n- Relax & Think: Engage your mind with calming yet stimulating challenges.\r\n- Hint System: Stuck? Use hints to nudge you in the right direction without giving away the answer.\r\n- Progressive Levels: Start easy and work your way up to more challenging puzzles as your skills grow.\r\n\r\nHow to play Unscramble That:\r\n\r\nEach level in Unscramble That challenges you to form hidden words by filling in the grid. Follow these simple steps to uncover the secret phrase:\r\n\r\n- Form the Word: Enter each letter from the columns into the squares directly above them to create a word.\r\n- Unscramble Letters: When multiple letters appear in the columns, use your vocabulary to guess the correct word.\r\n- Use Logic: For columns with a single letter, there\u2019s only one logical choice\u2014place it confidently.\r\n- Replace Letters: If the phrase doesn\u2019t make sense, don\u2019t hesitate to return the letters and try again.\r\n- Use the Clue: When stuck, read the provided clues to guide you toward the correct solution.\r\n\r\nWith these strategies, you\u2019ll piece together the hidden phrase and find the final solution.\r\n\r\nUnscramble That is more than just a word puzzle game. It's an adventure that expands your knowledge and challenges your mind.\r\n\r\nRelax & Think!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Unscramble That, the free word game that keeps you thinking and relaxing. Merging anagram challenges with nonogram puzzles, this game offers a fresh twist on classic puzzle gameplay by focusing on finding patterns and using logic.<br><br>In Unscramble That, your objective is to uncover hidden phrases by unscrambling words. Each level presents a series of clues that guide you to guess words and find the solution to the secret message. As you organize the letters and find the words, the hidden phrase gradually appears, leaving you with a sense of satisfaction.<br><br>The educational aspect of Unscramble That sets it apart from other word games. With each level, players uncover interesting historical facts, idioms, and quotes from literary figures. This enriching content not only broadens your lexicon but also deepens your appreciation for language.<br><br>- Find Pattern: Think outside the box as you identify hidden sequences and connections.<br>- Unscramble: Use your vocabulary to decode and reveal hidden phrases.<br>- Read Quotes: Discover wisdom through famous quotes and literary insights.<br>- Relax &amp; Think: Engage your mind with calming yet stimulating challenges.<br>- Hint System: Stuck? Use hints to nudge you in the right direction without giving away the answer.<br>- Progressive Levels: Start easy and work your way up to more challenging puzzles as your skills grow.<br><br>How to play Unscramble That:<br><br>Each level in Unscramble That challenges you to form hidden words by filling in the grid. Follow these simple steps to uncover the secret phrase:<br><br>- Form the Word: Enter each letter from the columns into the squares directly above them to create a word.<br>- Unscramble Letters: When multiple letters appear in the columns, use your vocabulary to guess the correct word.<br>- Use Logic: For columns with a single letter, there\u2019s only one logical choice\u2014place it confidently.<br>- Replace Letters: If the phrase doesn\u2019t make sense, don\u2019t hesitate to return the letters and try again.<br>- Use the Clue: When stuck, read the provided clues to guide you toward the correct solution.<br><br>With these strategies, you\u2019ll piece together the hidden phrase and find the final solution.<br><br>Unscramble That is more than just a word puzzle game. It&#39;s an adventure that expands your knowledge and challenges your mind.<br><br>Relax &amp; Think!",
